    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Choose one of the scenarios on the canvas.\r\n\r\n2. Create basic information about the person:\r\n   - Name\r\n   - Age or context\r\n   - Their role in the situation\r\n   - Why this situation is challenging for them\r\n\r\n3. Fill in the **Says / Thinks / Feels / Does** chart.\r\n\r\n4. Identify a frustration and goal.\r\n\r\n5. Write the problem statement using the template: **[User] needs a way to [need] because [insight/reason].**\r\n\r\n6. (Optional) After writing your own version, go back to Level 1 to use AI to check clarity, improve specificity, or strengthen the insight.\r\n",
